  "description": "BALLOR crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P -4 21 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C96 H85 N8 O36 Tb4. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb1C (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb1B (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb1A (Tb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.663-3.913 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.02-111.39°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb4(μ3-OH)4(nmc)8]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
